				<div class="cmp-teaser__content">
					<h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">
						
						Oklahoma School for the Blind Hosts Annual Spaghetti Dinner
					</h2>
					
					
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <p><b>MUSKOGEE –</b> Spaghetti and meatballs will be top of menu on<i> </i>Oct. 7 for a fundraising dinner that will benefit the Oklahoma School for the Blind.</p>
<p>The public is invited to attend from 5 p.m. to 8 p.m. at the OSB campus in the new gym. The school is located at 3300 Gibson Street in Muskogee.</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

					
    <div class="cmp-teaser__action-container">
        
