				<div class="cmp-teaser__content">
					<h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">
						
						National Disability Employment Awareness Month Celebrates 80th Anniversary
					</h2>
					
					
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <p><b>OKLAHOMA CITY </b>— It’s always exciting when an individual finds employment. It’s no different for a person with a disability. The difference lies in the barriers that can make it difficult for people with disabilities to find work.</p>
<p>In 2024, 1,045 Oklahomans with disabilities went to work thanks to the Oklahoma Department of Rehabilitation Services’ Vocational Rehabilitation and the Services for the Blind and Visually Impaired employment programs.</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

					
    <div class="cmp-teaser__action-container">
        
    <a class="cmp-teaser__action-link" href="/okdrs/newsroom/2025/09/ndeam2025.html" target="_parent" id="teaser-27d6f7e7cb-cta-d163a7da1f" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;teaser-27d6f7e7cb-cta-d163a7da1f&#34;:{&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/okdrs/newsroom/2025/09/ndeam2025.html&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Read more about National Disability Employment Awareness Month here&#34;,&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;nt:unstructured&#34;}}" data-cmp-clickable>Read more about National Disability Employment Awareness Month here</a>

    </div>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	
	
	
</div>

    

