					<h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">
						
						Seven seniors to graduate from OSD on May 21
					</h2>
					
					
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <p><b>SULPHUR</b> — Seven seniors will graduate May 21 from the Oklahoma School for the Deaf during a commencement ceremony at 1 p.m. in the Ken Brown Gymnasium.</p>
<p>OSD is located at 1100 East Oklahoma Ave. in Sulphur.</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

					
