               <meta itemprop="caption" content="Five people pose for a photo holding 150,000 big check. "/>
            </div>
            <div class="cmp-teaser__content">
               <h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">
                  
                  OK School for the Deaf’s Senior Citizens’ Hearing Aid Program gets needed boost thanks to a Masonic Charity Foundation grant 
               </h2>
               
               
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <p><b>EDMOND – </b>The Masonic Charity Foundation of Oklahoma awarded the Oklahoma School for the Deaf’s Senior Citizen Hearing Aid Program $150,000 grant for 2025.</p>
<p>Many Oklahoma seniors live on fixed incomes and without this assistance are unable to get hearing support or specialized equipment designed to alert those who are hard of hearing or deaf.</p>
<p>“Thanks to this generous grant, we will be able to serve more than 400 clients this year,” OSD Superintendent Heather Laine said. “Clients will not only benefit from hearing aids, but they could receive other specialized technology.”</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

               
    <div class="cmp-teaser__action-container">
        
    <a class="cmp-teaser__action-link" href="/okdrs/newsroom/2025/02/2025osdmasonic.html" target="_parent" id="teaser-8b84312415-cta-3e6e20829a" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;teaser-8b84312415-cta-3e6e20829a&#34;:{&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/okdrs/newsroom/2025/02/2025osdmasonic.html&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Read more about OSD’s Senior Citizens’ Hearing Aid Program&#34;,&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;nt:unstructured&#34;}}" data-cmp-clickable>Read more about OSD’s Senior Citizens’ Hearing Aid Program</a>

    </div>

            </div>
         </div>
