                     </picture>
                     
                  </div>
               </a>
               <meta itemprop="caption" content="OSD Bison photo collage of all the players on the team."/>
            </div>
            <div class="cmp-teaser__content">
               <h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">
                  
                  Three-Peat! Oklahoma School for the Deaf GPSD Football Champions
               </h2>
               
               
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <p><b>SULPHUR, Okla.</b>- Oklahoma School for the Deaf won the Great Plains Schools for the Deaf football championship for the third year in a row.</p>
<p>“This incredible achievement is a testament to the hard work, determination, and talent of our athletes,” OSD Superintendent Heather Laine said.</p>
<p>OSD’s football team plays eight-man football and competes against schools for the deaf from other states and public-school districts in this state.</p>
<p>“A huge shoutout to our 1st-year head coach, Sean Thomas Sledd and his coaching team for leading the team to success and continuing this winning journey. Your leadership and dedication have made all the difference,” Laine said.</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

               
    <div class="cmp-teaser__action-container">
        
    <a class="cmp-teaser__action-link" href="/okdrs/newsroom/2024/11/osd-football-champions.html" target="_parent" id="teaser-3416ba4d4f-cta-4d6a6ca112" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;teaser-3416ba4d4f-cta-4d6a6ca112&#34;:{&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/okdrs/newsroom/2024/11/osd-football-champions.html&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Read more about OSD&#39;s football champions&#34;,&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;nt:unstructured&#34;}}" data-cmp-clickable>Read more about OSD&#39;s football champions</a>

    </div>

            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   
   
   
   
   
